    "title": "Build-to-rent explodes in Atlanta - and agents are taking notice - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jonathan Delozier ,\n10 hours ago Atlanta leads the U.S. with roughly 72,000 single-family rental homes owned by institutional investors—about 30% of its SFR market, ten times the national average. In some suburbs, corporate ownership exceeds 70%. Build-to-rent units surged 1,381% since 2019. New legislation capping investors with 350+ homes has paused buying. Agents report first-time buyers being outbid by cash offers. Report authors warn Atlanta is a testing ground for Wall Street’s future national strategy. AI Summary. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
